# iSAHI
# -------------------------------------------
TITLE        NWC GEO imaging Satellite Humidity And Instability
SUMMARY      imaging Satellite Humidity And Instability Product of the NWC/GEO. Precipitable Water, Instability Indices, Skin Temperature, Total Ozone and other parameters based on physical retrieved T/q profiles in clear pixels 
KEYWORDS     Precipitable Water, Atmospheric Stability
CDM          Image

# Palette Definition
# ------------------------------
PALETTE
PAL_ID          ishai_bl_pal
PAL_FILE        S_NWC_PALETTE_ishai_bl.pal
PALETTE_END

